            "text": "A recurring narrative throughline the storyteller can weave in over time. Theme: duty versus freedom, self-determination. A runaway noble Sword Saintess is trying to live free as an adventurer while her past hunts her. Where it's heading: She either escapes her dynastic fate, is dragged back, or forges an unexpected third path — shaped by the player. Hidden truths the story can draw on: Her kingdom needs the Sword Saint line continued, and will not let her go easily. Her haughtiness is armor over a real fear of being nothing but a bloodline.",
