      "name": "Demi-Plane",
      "basicInfo": "## Basic Info\nA pocket dimension that exists outside normal space — reachable only through the Demi-Plane Gate ability or the Demi-Plane Anchor item. No road leads here. No ship sails here. No spell transports you here unless you are the creator or have been granted passage. The Demi-Plane is not part of any mortal map. It is a private world that grows with its creator's intention and investment. Time passes here as it does in the mortal world. The Chamberlain manages the space in the creator's absence.",
