      ],
      "name": "Blackmire Fort",
      "radius": 4,
      "region": "Scáthfenn",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "basicInfo": "The primary military installation in the Scáthfenn — a stone fortress on a rare island of solid ground, garrisoned jointly by Solasreach knights and Guild-hired scouts. Blackmire is the marsh's anchor: the only place with dry walls, warm fires, and a commander who knows which paths are currently passable. The fortress is also the launch point for expeditions into the deeper fen — monster subjugation, ruin exploration, and the increasingly urgent work of mapping paths that shift with every season.",
      "hiddenInfo": "The fortress's foundations rest on pre-Collapse stonework — an older structure that the marsh never quite swallowed. The garrison has mapped some of the chambers below. One of them contains a door that opens into the same pre-Collapse aqueduct system found in the Marches.",
      "visited": false,
      "lastVisitedTick": -1,
      "visitedAreas": []
