      "basicInfo": "The ancient burial mounds of a war that no one remembers starting — acres of green hills dotted with cairns, standing stones, and the occasional grave-goods that surface after heavy rain. The Barrows are scenic, atmospheric, and deeply cursed: the mutual annihilation spell that ended the war is still active, and the dead it claimed are regenerating. Slowly. The grass here grows greener than anywhere else in the Lowlands, and the locals know not to walk it at night. The Guild classifies it as a B-rank hazard zone and posts containment quests every season.",
