      "basicInfo": "A traveling merchant caravan that roams the Lowlands' river roads — a mobile market of tents, wagons, and colorful bunting that sets up in a different field every few days. The Wandering Market is where the Lowlands' rural folk go for goods they cannot make themselves: tools, cloth, potions, and the occasional enchanted item. The market is also a social hub — festivals, matchmaking, and the kind of gossip that travels faster than any courier. The market master is a genial halfling who knows every family in the Lowlands and their romantic histories.",
