    "Open Horizon Plain": {
      "name": "Open Horizon Plain",
      "basicInfo": "The great open ground of The Open Horizon — kilometers of flat savanna beneath an enormous sky, unbroken except by Skywatch Rise. The horizon line glows faintly warm in every direction, like embers at the world's edge. Walking it is an experience of scale: sound carries forever, weather is visible an hour off, and footprints fade slowly into the humming grass.",
      "x": 20,
