      "complexityType": "wilderness",
      "detailType": "basic",
      "known": true,
      "hiddenInfo": "This is the dimension's slate with no bias. Anything imagined standing on the plain with clear intent tends to become real here — which is why the Chamberlain advises against casual wishes and idle wandering thoughts. Prairie deer herds keep a slow migration circuit around the plain's edge that no one set and no one can change.",
