    "The Shifting Pools": {
      "name": "The Shifting Pools",
      "basicInfo": "The wandering heart of The Low Reaches — a constellation of shallow pools connected by channels that rearrange themselves between one visit and the next. No two days show the same water. The pools are clear and faintly warm, ringed with glow-reed, and home to bog wisps that drift from pool to pool like slow lanterns. Stepping-stone mounds rise and settle like breathing.",
      "x": 25,
