    "Rain Hollow": {
      "name": "Rain Hollow",
      "basicInfo": "A sheltered basin in The Low Reaches where the rain-scent is strongest — a soft round hollow ringed by reed banks, always smelling of a storm that has not arrived. Fine drizzle falls here most nights despite the clear sky above it, and the ground stays cool and damp. Marsh herbs grow thickest along its rim, and rain gathers overnight in a single clear pool at its center.",
      "x": 15,
      "y": 20,
