      "region": "The Hollow Vale",
      "complexityType": "complex",
      "detailType": "basic",
      "known": true,
      "hiddenInfo": "Each terrace measures precisely to the dimensions of a room in the Hidden Estate — the vale was shaped by the dimension's longing for a grander home. Any dwelling built on a terrace settles quickly and comfortably, as if the stone had already provided for its weight. Terrace sprites treat construction here as a shared family project, quietly continuing unfinished walls at night. Sprouting herbs found on individual terraces predict which future residents will thrive there.",
