    "Sheltered Vale": {
      "name": "Sheltered Vale",
      "basicInfo": "The calm valley floor of The Hollow Vale — level ground between the terraced slopes where the air never stirs and sound lands soft. Wildflowers line a single faint path, and the foxfire motes drift lowest here, close to knee height, as though the vale holds them like a bowl. The quietest defined space in the Demi-Plane and the most construction-friendly ground after the Westreach.",
      "x": 15,
