    "Great Prairie": {
      "name": "Great Prairie",
      "basicInfo": "The vast prairie heart of The Deep Expanse — flat firm ground under a high clear sky, threaded by tall blue-green grasses that wave in slow unison and hum almost audibly as the wind passes. The largest single open space in the Demi-Plane: a blank canvas the size of a small country. Crossing it takes a full day by foot, and the horizon stays exactly as far away the entire way.",
