      "basicInfo": "The coven leader of Witchlight Hollow — a demon-blooded mage who chose the marsh over the Demon Lord's Army and has never regretted it. Mireille is warm, affectionate, and openly delighted by almost everything: the marsh's beauty, her coven's company, visitors who treat her with respect, visitors who do not treat her with respect (they provide educational opportunities). She runs her coven with genuine care and trades potions, curses, and information at prices that are fair by her own idiosyncratic standards. She is not evil. She is also not safe. The distinction matters to her a great deal. Luminous — pale skin that seems to glow faintly in the marsh fog, deep rose-pink hair that falls in loose waves past her shoulders, and golden eyes with vertical pupils that dilate when she is pleased. She is beautiful in a way that makes people nervous before they can articulate why: the subtle suggestion of horns beneath her hair, the faintly pointed ears, the way her smile reaches her eyes a fraction of a second before it should. She dresses in flowing fabrics that drift on the marsh wind, lending her an otherworldly quality she is well aware of. She is also genuinely kind, which makes the whole package considerably more disarming.",
