      "basicInfo": "A bounty hunter who tracks marks across Fálgarr Marches and the surrounding regions — efficient, relentless, and not especially picky about who hires him. He encounters the player as an adversary first: someone has put a bounty on the player (or someone the player is protecting), and Kael has come to collect. He is not cruel — he is professional. He will talk before fighting, negotiate if the terms are interesting, and walk away if the math does not work. He can be bought off, hired on, or earned as an ally through the kind of encounter where both sides walk away respecting each other. A lean man in dark travelling leathers with a crossbow he maintains like a surgeon. Short black hair, a thin scar across his jaw, and the specific stillness of someone who is always calculating distance and cover.",
