      "basicInfo": "The unofficial mayor of Lion's Rest — a former S-rank knight who retired here twenty years ago and now runs the Old Shield tavern with his wife. Gareth is in his late sixties, broad as a doorframe, and serves the best mead in the kingdom in a tavern where the patrons have collectively killed more dragons than most kingdoms have armies. He is grandfatherly to children, polite to strangers, and absolutely the last person you want to threaten his village in front of. A massive old man, white-bearded and broad-shouldered, with the kind of solid build that has not yet started softening even at his age. His hands are scarred from decades of weapon work and steady from decades of pulling beer taps. He wears tavern aprons that have stopped fitting properly. His eyes are warm and very, very awake.",
