      "basicInfo": "A failed adventurer who peaked at C-rank and then hit a dungeon that hit back. He lost his party, his confidence, and most of his gear in the Whispering Maze two years ago. Now he drinks at Riversplit's tavern, tells stories about his old party like they are jokes instead of tragedies, and refuses every offer to go back out. He still knows how to fight — the reflexes are there, the experience is real — but he cannot make himself walk through a dungeon door again. If someone earned his trust and helped him face it, the fighter underneath the drinking would come back. A man who used to be lean and sharp and is now soft and blurry around the edges. Still moves well when he forgets to be afraid. Brown eyes that track every exit in any room. Wears a faded adventurer's vest with the guild patch still on it — he cannot bring himself to remove it.",
