      "hiddenInfo": "Rhosyn knows the confederation is fracturing under her and is quietly terrified that she is the last Speaker who can hold it. She is looking — without admitting it — for someone, insider or outsider, strong and trusted enough to give the Clans a future that is neither isolation nor surrender.",
