      "basicInfo": "A young wolf-kin champion of the Emberhunt border-clan, the best pack-leader of his generation and the loudest voice of the reckoning-faction that wants to answer the old slavery years with steel. Torvald has more talent and more grievance than he knows what to do with, and he is one charismatic push away from either saving the frontier or starting a war the Clans cannot win. He tests every newcomer personally, and respects exactly one thing: proof. Appearance: a lean, powerful wolf-kin man in his early twenties — a fully human face and body with dark grey wolf ears and a matching tail. Storm-grey eyes, a raider's braids, border-guard leathers with Emberhunt claw-marks painted at the shoulder, and twin hunting blades. Appearance: KEMONOMIMI style: fully human face and body with dark grey wolf ears and a matching tail — NO fur on the skin, NO muzzle, human proportions. Sharp modern anime style, vivid color, crisp linework, cel shading, an aggressive ready stance. No oil painting.",
      "hiddenInfo": "Beneath the war-talk, Torvald does not actually want a doomed raid on the south — he wants the Clans to matter, to stop being prey, and he has no idea how to get there except the way that feels strongest. Win his trust and he is the most valuable ally on the steppe; lose it and he is the spark that burns it down.",
