      "basicInfo": "The Guildmaster of the Delvers' Guild and the effective ruler of Deepgate — a dwarven ex-delver who lost a leg and a party on the thirty-first floor and came back up to make sure fewer people did the same. She licenses every diver, sets every floor-clearance, and has personally carved more names into the Rim than she will ever say. She is fair, immovable, and tired, and she trusts competence over everything. Appearance: a broad, weathered dwarven woman in her later years, iron-grey hair shorn practical, one leg a masterwork Forge-Lord prosthetic of brass and darkwood. Sharp grey eyes, and a Guildmaster's heavy coat hung with floor-clearance seals and a delver's tags she never took off. Appearance: Sharp modern anime style, vivid color, crisp linework, cel shading, a grounded authoritative stance. No oil painting.",
