  "storyStarts": {
    "Random": {
      "name": "Random",
      "description": "Random arrival — the world decides how you got here and where you land. Let fate choose your starting point.",
      "storyStart": "[IF REINCARNATION: The player was born in Aerfála and has lived here their whole life. Write the opening as a native at a meaningful turning point — the day they decide to register at the Guild, leave their village, or take their first quest. Their cheat skill is an innate ability that manifested naturally. No arrival, no summoning, no portal.]\n\n[IF ANY OTHER ARRIVAL METHOD: The between-world has no name and no geometry. You are passing through it the way light passes through water — refracted, changed, and deposited somewhere the physics do not quite match what you remember. The transition ends. You arrive.]\n\nThe world has not yet learned your name. That changes today.",
