      "description": "You have come to the Sunmane Steppe a stranger — outworlder, envoy, wanderer, or fugitive — and been received, warily, under the Clans' ancient guest-right at the great Moot. You are fed, you are watched, and you are one courtesy away from welcome or one insult away from being escorted to the border, or worse.",
