    {
      "attributes": {},
      "backstory": "Your previous life ended at twenty-six. You were a research fellow at a national\nlaboratory studying quantum information theory, and you died in a traffic accident\nat a pedestrian crossing you crossed safely every day for three years. Your last\nthought was annoyance that you would not finish the paper you were drafting.\n\nYou woke up in an infant body in a noble's nursery in Solasreach. You remembered\neverything. The first three years were the worst — you could not speak, you could\nnot write, and your nursery maid kept making decisions about your wardrobe that\nyou had strong opinions about and no way to communicate.\n\nYou are now twenty years old. The Akizuki family is minor nobility, your father\nis in serious debt to interests you have not yet identified, and your two older\nsisters have made the predictable choices — one married well, one became a Knight.\nYou have made a different choice. You are going to study magic at Crossroads\nAcademy on a full scholarship that you arranged by demonstrating, at age fourteen,\na level of theoretical understanding that the Academy's faculty considered\nimpossible.\n\nYour cheat skill is Appraisal. You can read anyone's stats, weaknesses, and\nintentions with a glance. The Akizuki name protects you politically; your skill\nprotects you tactically. You have one childhood friend — your maid's daughter,\nwho knows about your memories and is the only person in the world you can be\nhonest with. You love her. She loves you. You have not yet figured out how to\ntell her this. Once you do, you suspect the rest of your plans will require\nrevision.\n\nThe court has not yet realized what you are. By the time they do, you intend\nto be running it.\n",
