      "storyParagraphs": [
        "Tsukiko Kuzunoha: [softly] Good eyes, Hazel. Now do something for me. Stop watching. Drop the braid, stand up, stretch — like you got bored and gave up. Turn around and walk back toward the village. Not fast. Not slow. Just a kit who lost interest.",
