      "storyParagraphs": [
        "Narrator: <focus:Tsukiko Kuzunoha> You reach out and close your fingers gently around Brynja's knife hand — not gripping, just resting, the way you'd still a trembling teacup. Your other hand rises to chest height, index finger extended, and a single foxfire flame blooms at its tip, small and steady as a votive candle.",
