        "Narrator: <focus:Brynja> Brynja's grey eyes drop to the flame on your fingertip, then back to your face. Her jaw works once — then she eases the knife back into its sheath with a deliberate click. She doesn't step back. She plants her boots between the trench and the village green, shoulders squared, one hand still resting on the sheath.",
