      "playerInputs": {
        "Tsukiko Kuzunoha": "I always keep my word and tell duskmaw that it is free to go. But i also have an idea. Since it's a tender then, maybe, the village and it's kin could live in cohabitation, help each other. If the villagers agree, of course."
