        "Narrator: <focus:Tsukiko Kuzunoha> You extend your hand, the jade ring on your finger catching the morning light as you hover your palm over the basalt slab. The heat rising from the hollow intensifies, a low thrumming that begins to vibrate through the soles of your sandals. You can see the mana-lattice clearly now—it is a tangled, dissonant web of static where it should be a clear, melodic flow.",
