      "storyParagraphs": [
        "Tsukiko Kuzunoha: [warmly] I'm Tsukiko Kuzunoha — a shrine maiden, lately of a fox region far from here. It's a pleasure to meet you both. And please, don't be embarrassed — that was a fine save, Kaelen. The barrel only needed a little help getting home.",
        "Winston Ashford: [laughing loudly] Tsukiko! Well met, miss! If you can move barrels with a wave of your hand, I can't wait to see what else you can do — welcome to Whiskerbrook, properly! He beams at you with an enthusiasm that seems to make him twice his size.",
        "Kaelen Ashford: [sheepish] A pleasure to meet you properly, Lady Tsukiko. He rubs the back of his neck and looks down at his boots. Though I'll admit — I'd have rather anyone but you saw me wrestling that cask like a fool. Grateful it was you all the same.",
        "Mira Thistledown: [briskly, clapping her hands] Oh, enough idling, you two! That cider won't walk itself to the tasting table — and after yourperformance, Kaelen, I want it rolled, not thrown! Her rabbit ears twitch as she turns back to you, bustling with warmth. Come along, Tsukiko — the flower displays won't arrange themselves, and I've been saving the prettiest spot by the oak just for your eye!"
      ],
